WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.600
Add a photo to the example page.

00:02.600 --> 00:05.800
Choose a photo from the library.

00:05.800 --> 00:08.700
Give it a Polaroid frame · Pro.

00:08.700 --> 00:11.200
Drag the handle to resize.

00:11.200 --> 00:14.400
